### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090
@contentType = application/json

# ============================================================
# TOPOLOGÍA
# ============================================================

### Obtener todos los switches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topology/switches
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener switches activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topology/switches/active
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener switch por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topology/switches/21
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener todos los hosts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topology/hosts
Accept: application/json

###

### Actualizar estado de un switch (desde Ryu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/topology/switches/21/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "active": true
}

# ============================================================
# MÉTRICAS
# ============================================================

###

### Métricas del switch 21 - últimos 30 minutos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/ports/21?minutes=30
Accept: application/json

###

### Última métrica del switch 21 puerto 3
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/ports/21/3/latest
Accept: application/json

###

### Ingestar métrica manualmente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/ingest
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "switchId": "21",
  "portId": 3,
  "rxBytes": 1234567,
  "txBytes": 987654,
  "rxPackets": 1500,
  "txPackets": 1200,
  "txErrors": 0,
  "rxErrors": 0,
  "txDropped": 0,
  "rxDropped": 0,
  "durationSec": 60
}

# ============================================================
# ANOMALÍAS
# ============================================================

###

### Todas las anomalías
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anomalies
Accept: application/json

###

### Solo anomalías sin resolver
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anomalies?unresolvedOnly=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Anomalías CRITICAL sin resolver
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anomalies?severity=CRITICAL&unresolvedOnly=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Anomalías por switch
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anomalies/switch/21
Accept: application/json

###

### Anomalías por host
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anomalies/host/h1
Accept: application/json

###

### Estadísticas de anomalías 24h
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anomalies/stats
Accept: application/json

###

### Resolver una anomalía
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/anomalies/1/resolve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "resolvedBy": "admin",
  "note": "Ataque contenido, tráfico normalizado"
}

# ============================================================
# ALERT RULES
# ============================================================

###

### Obtener todas las reglas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alert-rules
Accept: application/json

###

### Crear regla de alerta
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alert-rules
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "DDoS Test Rule",
  "description": "Detectar tráfico anómalo en hosts",
  "metricType": "rx_pps",
  "operator": ">",
  "threshold": 800,
  "durationSec": 60,
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "appliesTo": "LEAF",
  "enabled": true
}

###

### Actualizar regla
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/alert-rules/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "DDoS Test Rule",
  "metricType": "rx_pps",
  "operator": ">",
  "threshold": 600,
  "durationSec": 30,
  "severity": "CRITICAL",
  "appliesTo": "ALL",
  "enabled": true
}

###

### Activar o desactivar regla
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/alert-rules/1/toggle

###

### Eliminar regla
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/alert-rules/1